ations, premium UI, clean typography, dashboard-style, colorful; include a shareable, LinkedIn-ready visual.   - Accessibility: keyboard navigable, high-contrast options, descriptive alt text.   - Output format: a single self-contained HTML file (index.html) with inline CSS and JS; no external dependencies required for offline usage.   - Documentation: in-file comments detailing data flow and user interactions (no code snippets in explanations).   - Light/Dark theme toggle included.  - Interactivity and behavior   - All charts, filters, and cards must be interactive and render in the single HTML file without server calls.   - Provide graceful fallbacks and clear messaging if data is synthetic.   - Include a data source note: data freshness guarantees, assumed data gaps, and how synthetic data is generated if needed.  - Deliverables   - One index.html file, fully self-contained, with inline CSS and JS.   - Inline documentation comments describing data flow and interactions.   - Guidance within the UI on data sources, freshness, and assumptions.  Please tailor the UI text and visuals for a premium dashboard look, and ensure the artifact is ready for download and immediate use without additional tooling. If you need to adjust any assumptions (e.g., number of cities, pollutants shown), specify them in your plan.
